docs {
  GET /project-lines

  ## Scenarios
  - no active cycle (404)
  - Engineer — assignee=oid-engineer-2 (200)
  - PMO — metier=H-DESIGN (200)
  - CPO — forbidden (403)
  - Engineer — all (200)
  - PMO — all (200)
  - no JWT / role (401)

  `GET {{baseUrl}}/project-lines`

  Auth: Bearer `{{token}}`.

  ## Request schema

  ```json
  {
    "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "assignee": {
        "description": "Filter by assignee OID (PMO/Admin/RCRC).",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "metier": {
        "description": "Filter by project line métier (PMO/Admin/RCRC).",
        "enum": [
          "H-DESIGN",
          "H-TUNING",
          "H-SOFTWARE",
          "H-CUSTOMER",
          "H-PROJECT",
          "H-NP"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "title": "ListProjectLinesQuery",
    "type": "object"
  }
  ```

